---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<MainLayout
  title="Research | Shivan Tillekeratne"
  description="Research interests and academic work of Shivan Tillekeratne in artificial intelligence, machine learning, explainable AI, and intelligent systems."
>

  <!-- Page Header -->
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-20">

    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-500">
        Research
      </p>

      <h1 class="mt-2 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 md:text-5xl">
        Exploring AI beyond the implementation.
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-gray-600">
        My research interests focus on understanding and applying
        artificial intelligence techniques to practical problems, with
        particular interest in explainability, machine learning,
        deep learning, and intelligent systems.
      </p>
    </div>


    <!-- Research Interests -->
    <div class="mt-20">

      <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-500">
        Research Interests
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900">
        Areas I'm interested in exploring
      </h2>

      <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">

        <article class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">
            Explainable AI
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-gray-600">
            Understanding techniques that improve the interpretability
            and transparency of AI and deep learning models.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">
            Machine Learning & Deep Learning
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-gray-600">
            Exploring machine learning and deep learning approaches for
            solving practical problems involving complex data.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">
            Intelligent Systems
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-gray-600">
            Investigating how AI techniques can be integrated into useful,
            reliable, and practical intelligent systems.
          </p>
        </article>

      </div>

    </div>


    <!-- Independent Study -->
    <div class="mt-20 border-t border-gray-100 pt-16">

      <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-500">
        Independent Study
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-2 max-w-4xl text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900">
        A Review of Explainable Artificial Intelligence (XAI) Techniques
        in Deep Learning Models
      </h2>

      <p class="mt-6 max-w-4xl text-lg leading-8 text-gray-600">
        A review exploring explainable artificial intelligence techniques
        used to improve the interpretability and understanding of deep
        learning models.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2">

        <div>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-500">
            Focus
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-gray-600">
            Explainable artificial intelligence, interpretability,
            deep learning, and techniques for understanding model
            behaviour.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-500">
            Context
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-gray-600">
            An academic review developed as part of my independent study
            in artificial intelligence.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>


    <!-- Research Project -->
    <div class="mt-20 border-t border-gray-100 pt-16">

      <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-500">
        Research Project
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900">
        Hybrid Optical flow and Segmentation-guided Spatiotemporal Saliency Refinement 
for video-based Human Activity Recognition
      </h2>

      <p class="mt-6 max-w-4xl text-lg leading-8 text-gray-600">
        A research-oriented project exploring human activity recognition
        from video using optical flow, segmentation, and deep learning
        techniques.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8">

        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-500">
          Technologies & Techniques
        </h3>

        <p class="mt-3 text-gray-700">
          Python · PyTorch · PyTorchVideo · OpenCV · RAFT · SAM 2
        </p>

      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 max-w-4xl">

        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-500">
          Research Focus
        </h3>

        <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-gray-600">
          The project investigates approaches for understanding human
          activities from video by combining motion information,
          segmentation, and deep learning-based video analysis.
        </p>

      </div>

      <div class="mt-8">

        <a
          href="/projects"
          class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 transition hover:text-gray-900 hover:underline"
        >
          View projects →
        </a>

      </div>

    </div>


    <!-- Future Direction -->
    <div class="mt-20 border-t border-gray-100 pt-16">

      <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-500">
        Future Direction
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900">
        Continuing toward research
      </h2>

      <p class="mt-6 max-w-4xl text-lg leading-8 text-gray-600">
        My current goal is to continue developing as an AI Engineer while
        exploring the areas of artificial intelligence that interest me
        most. As I develop that direction further, I intend to pursue
        higher studies in a research area where I can make a meaningful
        contribution.
      </p>

    </div>

  </section>

</MainLayout>